WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Ancient plants that have not yet been discovered by modern scientific research

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,120
These two fruits should be among the twelve

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:07,400
It turned out to be an old witch from the primitive mountains. It scared me, young man.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,000
You two magical fruits

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,160
Which mountain was it excavated from?

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,840
Can you tell me the specific coordinates in detail?

7
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,760
Sorry old man

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,720
This is the trade secret of my meal. No comment.

9
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,520
Wang Qingshan is the top prisoner of botany in China

10
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,840
If he is allowed to follow the devil's lead and investigate,

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,400
Maybe we can find some clues

12
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,720
Never say more than half a word

13
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,160
Brother, you are so unkind.

14
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,640
Just now you were standing on the side of the car, shouting and laughing

15
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,160
Didn't it mean it came from an unknown mountain?

16
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,200
Why is the leaf hidden now?

17
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,040
Unparalleled wild fruits from the mountains

18
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,480
What a miracle of nature, young man

19
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,320
I also want to ask you a few more questions about counting seconds.

20
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,920
The old gentleman will discuss knowledge for another day.

21
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,840
I'm a small businessman and I still have to make a living.

22
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,800
Miracle fruits from deep mountains

23
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,960
Duck egg fruit and goose egg grapes cost 100 yuan per pound

24
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:43,160
If it doesn't taste good, I'll give you a refund on the spot for 100 yuan per catty. You're stealing money. The fruit is made of gold.

25
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:46,480
And can this weird-looking thing be eaten? What if it’s poisonous? Don’t worry.

26
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:48,280
I grew up eating in the mountains and have a very strong body.

27
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,920
I can kill a tiger with one punch. If it's poisonous, I can do it in front of everyone.

28
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,440
Eat two at one go?

29
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,520
Boss, this smell is really too good
